    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nAdare is a magnificent five-bedroom detached residence occupying a generous and private 0.3-acre site on the highly sought-after Rochestown Road. Extending to approximately 359 sq.m. (3,864 sq.ft.), this impressive family home offers exceptional living space, privacy, and convenience in one of Cork's most desirable residential locations.\nSet behind electronic gates with direct access from Rochestown Road, the property enjoys a private front garden and a substantial driveway providing ample off-street parking for multiple vehicles. The mature setting creates an immediate sense of privacy and exclusivity, while the beautifully maintained grounds enhance the overall appeal of this outstanding home.\nThe accommodation is both spacious and versatile, designed to meet the needs of modern family living. There are five generously proportioned bedrooms, including two with ensuite bathrooms, providing excellent comfort and privacy for family members and guests alike. A well-appointed main family bathroom and convenient guest WCs on the ground floor further complement the accommodation.\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private south-facing garden, a highly desirable feature that allows natural sunlight to be enjoyed throughout the day. Mature hedging surrounds the garden, creating a tranquil and secluded outdoor space ideal for families, entertaining, or simply relaxing. A private patio area provides the perfect setting for outdoor dining and summer gatherings.\nThe home is presented with comfort and energy efficiency in mind, featuring oil-fired central heating, concrete floors at first and second floor level, double-glazed windows, and attic insulation. These features combine to create a warm and comfortable living environment throughout the year.\nLocation is one of Adare's best features as it is situated just a ten-minute walk from Douglas Village, residents can enjoy an excellent selection of shops, restaurants, cafés, schools, and local amenities. The South Link Road network is less than a minute's drive away, providing immediate access to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport, and major routes throughout the region."
      },
      {
